        {
          "id": "the_collapsed_base_rate_reproduces_the_reference_baseRateByAge_table",
          "description": "S13 and S14 against `baseRateByAge_1_2020`, the reference's own generator output, at nine (pollutant-process, day, model year, fuel) cells spanning all four fuels and all three exhaust pollutant-processes. Every value here is the snapshot's, to its stored six significant figures. The electricity THC rate is 0 and is asserted as 0: an electric car emits no hydrocarbons and the rate table says so, which is a different thing from a cohort that was dropped.",
